WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.167
Step 1. Open the discussion.

1.2
00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:06.343
Open the encounter's Notes section and select the discussion.

1.3
00:00:06.343 --> 00:00:09.698
Anyone who can see and write in it can rename it,

1.4
00:00:09.698 --> 00:00:12.594
not only the person who started it.

2.1
00:00:12.594 --> 00:00:15.656
Step 2. Open the Rename discussion dialog.

2.2
00:00:15.656 --> 00:00:20.039
Select the pencil button in the heading of the discussion.

3.1
00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:22.161
Step 3. Change the title.

3.2
00:00:22.161 --> 00:00:28.949
Give the discussion a title that helps the care team find it. The title is required.

4.1
00:00:28.949 --> 00:00:32.765
Step 4. Save the new title. Select Save Changes.

4.2
00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:38.615
The list shows the new title, and the discussion keeps all its messages.
